 "notes": [
  "Per-eye cells print the Snellen acuity with its logMAR value in parentheses (headers 'BCVA—Snellen (LogMAR)'); the parenthesized logMAR value is cited. Snellen values were transformed into logMAR values for analysis, and low acuities were assigned logMAR values according to Holladay (Methods); these values are kept as printed.",
  "Phakic eyes had combined phacoemulsification just before the vitrectomy (same session).",
  "Rows R16/R17 and R23/R24 of t001 are the two eyes of one patient each.",
  "Every eye has a value at every tabulated visit (missing_data observed); all eyes were followed for 12 months (Abstract).",
  "No MNV reactivation and no additional anti-VEGF injection during the 12 months; four patients developed an epiretinal membrane, none operated (Results).",
  "Treatment 'other': the defining intervention is the subretinal amniotic membrane graft, not covered by the vitrectomy category; role treated (new surgical technique).",
  "Geographic atrophy is counted as indication 'other'; prior treatment of the GA eyes is not stated."
 ],
